@DTR.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

### Time-in with body student ID 1, which corresponds to "Juan dela Cruz" in our seeded data
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/time-in
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "StudentID": 1
}

###
GET {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/history/1
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/time-out
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "StudentID": 1,
    "Remarks": "Feeling unwell."
}

### admin
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Time-out without time-in — mag-tthrow ng exception
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/time-out
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..STe6lymgVBRi5lXYe_cOBq6jO4o_DDYzVKx-Mi_TVHM
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "remarks": "test"
}

### Login
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "student1",
    "password": "student123"
}

### Time-in student
POST {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/time-in
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..vnRygAq_d9X_XU7yfVS20SFwoioq2JUrcAwyGwD_2WM

### Time-in student
GET {{DTR.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/history
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..vnRygAq_d9X_XU7yfVS20SFwoioq2JUrcAwyGwD_2WM